{"id": "d01", "type": "factual", "question": "ViT 是用哪些数据集预训练的？", "gold_answer": "ImageNet-21k（1400 万张图，21843 类）与 JFT-300M（3.03 亿张图）。", "gold_chunk_ids": ["a48a91d861ebae39::1::2", "a48a91d861ebae39::1::3"], "gold_doc_ids": ["a48a91d861ebae39"], "difficulty": "easy", "expected_tool": "kb_search", "verify_key": "JFT-300M"}
{"id": "d02", "type": "factual", "question": "MAE 的掩码比例是多少？", "gold_answer": "75%。论文指出高掩码比例能构成一个有意义的自监督任务。", "gold_chunk_ids": ["4ae6e08b5260339b::1::1", "4ae6e08b5260339b::1::2"], "gold_doc_ids": ["4ae6e08b5260339b"], "difficulty": "easy", "expected_tool": "kb_search", "verify_key": "75%"}
{"id": "d03", "type": "factual", "question": "DETR 在 COCO val 上的检测精度是多少？", "gold_answer": "42.0 AP，与调优良好的 Faster R-CNN 基线相当。", "gold_chunk_ids": ["ffd2e188002081fa::1::2"], "gold_doc_ids": ["ffd2e188002081fa"], "difficulty": "easy", "expected_tool": "kb_search", "verify_key": "42.0 AP"}
{"id": "d04", "type": "factual", "question": "Swin-L 在 ImageNet-1k 上的 top-1 准确率是多少？", "gold_answer": "87.3%。", "gold_chunk_ids": ["f3475bd56e821f54::1::2"], "gold_doc_ids": ["f3475bd56e821f54"], "difficulty": "easy", "expected_tool": "kb_search", "verify_key": "87.3%"}
{"id": "d05", "type": "factual", "question": "DETR 训练时使用什么优化器？", "gold_answer": "AdamW，初始学习率 1e-4，权重衰减 1e-4，batch size 64。", "gold_chunk_ids": ["ffd2e188002081fa::1::2"], "gold_doc_ids": ["ffd2e188002081fa"], "difficulty": "medium", "expected_tool": "kb_search", "verify_key": "AdamW"}
{"id": "d06", "type": "factual", "question": "ViT 把图像切分成多大的 patch？", "gold_answer": "16x16 像素的固定大小 patch。", "gold_chunk_ids": ["a48a91d861ebae39::1::1"], "gold_doc_ids": ["a48a91d861ebae39"], "difficulty": "easy", "expected_tool": "kb_search", "verify_key": "16x16"}
{"id": "d07", "type": "factual", "question": "MAE 预训练用了多大的 batch size？", "gold_answer": "ImageNet-1k 设置下 batch size 为 4096，训练 1600 个 epoch。", "gold_chunk_ids": ["4ae6e08b5260339b::1::2", "4ae6e08b5260339b::1::3"], "gold_doc_ids": ["4ae6e08b5260339b"], "difficulty": "medium", "expected_tool": "kb_search", "verify_key": "4096"}
{"id": "d08", "type": "factual", "question": "Swin 在 ADE20K 语义分割上的 mIoU 是多少？", "gold_answer": "53.5 mIoU，显著超越此前的最好结果。", "gold_chunk_ids": ["f3475bd56e821f54::1::2"], "gold_doc_ids": ["f3475bd56e821f54"], "difficulty": "medium", "expected_tool": "kb_search", "verify_key": "53.5 mIoU"}
{"id": "d09", "type": "comparative", "question": "ViT 和 Swin 的注意力机制有什么不同？", "gold_answer": "ViT 在整幅图上做全局多头自注意力（MSA）；Swin 把注意力限制在非重叠的局部窗口内，并在相邻层之间移位窗口以建立跨窗口连接，复杂度与图像尺寸成线性。", "gold_chunk_ids": ["a48a91d861ebae39::1::1", "f3475bd56e821f54::1::1"], "gold_doc_ids": ["a48a91d861ebae39", "f3475bd56e821f54"], "difficulty": "hard", "expected_tool": "kb_search", "verify_key": ["multiheaded self-attention", "shifted windowing"]}
{"id": "d10", "type": "comparative", "question": "Swin 和 ViT 哪个采用了层次化表示？", "gold_answer": "Swin。它从小尺寸 patch 出发，在更深的层中逐步合并相邻 patch，从而构建层次化表示。", "gold_chunk_ids": ["f3475bd56e821f54::1::1"], "gold_doc_ids": ["f3475bd56e821f54"], "difficulty": "medium", "expected_tool": "kb_search", "verify_key": "hierarchical"}
{"id": "d11", "type": "comparative", "question": "DETR 相比传统检测器去掉了哪些手工设计的组件？", "gold_answer": "去掉了非极大值抑制（NMS）与锚框生成等手工组件。", "gold_chunk_ids": ["ffd2e188002081fa::1::1", "ffd2e188002081fa::1::2"], "gold_doc_ids": ["ffd2e188002081fa"], "difficulty": "medium", "expected_tool": "kb_search", "verify_key": "non-maximum suppression"}
{"id": "d12", "type": "comparative", "question": "ViT 和 Swin 各自的预训练数据集是什么？", "gold_answer": "ViT 用 ImageNet-21k 与 JFT-300M；Swin 的预训练使用 ImageNet-21k。", "gold_chunk_ids": ["a48a91d861ebae39::1::2", "f3475bd56e821f54::1::2"], "gold_doc_ids": ["a48a91d861ebae39", "f3475bd56e821f54"], "difficulty": "medium", "expected_tool": "kb_search", "verify_key": ["JFT-300M", "ImageNet-21k"]}
{"id": "d13", "type": "inductive", "question": "这些论文里用到了哪些评估指标？", "gold_answer": "分类用 top-1 准确率；检测用 AP（box AP / mask AP）；分割用 mIoU。", "gold_chunk_ids": ["f3475bd56e821f54::1::2", "ffd2e188002081fa::1::2"], "gold_doc_ids": ["f3475bd56e821f54", "ffd2e188002081fa"], "difficulty": "hard", "expected_tool": "kb_search", "verify_key": ["mIoU", "42.0 AP"]}
{"id": "d14", "type": "inductive", "question": "哪些论文在 COCO 或 ADE20K 上做了评测？", "gold_answer": "Swin 在 COCO 检测与 ADE20K 分割上评测；DETR 在 COCO 2017 上评测。", "gold_chunk_ids": ["f3475bd56e821f54::1::2", "ffd2e188002081fa::1::2"], "gold_doc_ids": ["f3475bd56e821f54", "ffd2e188002081fa"], "difficulty": "medium", "expected_tool": "kb_search", "verify_key": ["ADE20K", "COCO 2017"]}
{"id": "d15", "type": "inductive", "question": "哪些论文报告了在 ImageNet 上的 top-1 准确率？", "gold_answer": "ViT（88.55%）、Swin（87.3%）、MAE（87.8%）都报告了 ImageNet 上的 top-1 准确率。", "gold_chunk_ids": ["a48a91d861ebae39::1::2", "a48a91d861ebae39::1::3", "f3475bd56e821f54::1::2", "4ae6e08b5260339b::1::2", "4ae6e08b5260339b::1::3"], "gold_doc_ids": ["a48a91d861ebae39", "f3475bd56e821f54", "4ae6e08b5260339b"], "difficulty": "hard", "expected_tool": "kb_search", "verify_key": ["88.55%", "87.3%", "87.8%"]}
{"id": "d16", "type": "reasoning", "question": "为什么 MAE 要采用很高的掩码比例？", "gold_answer": "因为高掩码比例会构成一个不平凡的任务，要求模型对场景有整体理解，而不是从邻近可见 patch 做外推；同时它还大幅降低了计算量。", "gold_chunk_ids": ["4ae6e08b5260339b::1::1", "4ae6e08b5260339b::1::2"], "gold_doc_ids": ["4ae6e08b5260339b"], "difficulty": "hard", "expected_tool": "kb_search", "verify_key": "holistic understanding"}
{"id": "d17", "type": "reasoning", "question": "为什么 Swin 适合语义分割和目标检测这类密集预测任务？", "gold_answer": "因为移位窗口机制的复杂度与图像尺寸成线性，而标准全局自注意力的复杂度是二次的。", "gold_chunk_ids": ["f3475bd56e821f54::1::1", "f3475bd56e821f54::1::2"], "gold_doc_ids": ["f3475bd56e821f54"], "difficulty": "hard", "expected_tool": "kb_search", "verify_key": "linear in image size"}
{"id": "d18", "type": "reasoning", "question": "为什么 DETR 在推理时不需要非极大值抑制？", "gold_answer": "因为它通过匈牙利算法在预测与真值之间做一对一二分匹配，一个目标只对应一个预测，因此不需要 NMS 去重。", "gold_chunk_ids": ["ffd2e188002081fa::1::1", "ffd2e188002081fa::1::2"], "gold_doc_ids": ["ffd2e188002081fa"], "difficulty": "hard", "expected_tool": "kb_search", "verify_key": "one-to-one"}
{"id": "d19", "type": "reasoning", "question": "为什么 ViT 在训练数据不足时表现不佳？", "gold_answer": "论文指出 ViT 缺少卷积网络那样的归纳偏置，在数据量不足时泛化不好——仅在 ImageNet-1k 上训练的 ViT 不如 ResNet。", "gold_chunk_ids": ["a48a91d861ebae39::1::2", "a48a91d861ebae39::1::3"], "gold_doc_ids": ["a48a91d861ebae39"], "difficulty": "hard", "expected_tool": "kb_search", "verify_key": "does not generalize well"}
{"id": "d20", "type": "reasoning", "question": "MAE 为什么能显著降低预训练的计算量？", "gold_answer": "因为编码器只处理可见的 patch 子集；在 75% 掩码率下编码器只处理 25% 的 patch。", "gold_chunk_ids": ["4ae6e08b5260339b::1::2"], "gold_doc_ids": ["4ae6e08b5260339b"], "difficulty": "medium", "expected_tool": "kb_search", "verify_key": "25% of the patches"}
